* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VIN VCONT1 VCONT2 VCONT3 VCONT4 VCONT5 VP VB1 VREF VB3 VB2 VB4 VB5
.model DIODE D(IS=1e-14 N=1)
CFLY VX1 VX2 1p
CO VP VN 1p
COP VP VSS 1p
D1 VN VX2 DIODE
L1 VX1 VX3 1n
M1 VISR VCONT1 VIN VIN pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
